{'symbol': 'STE', 'date': '2023-02-01 16:52:00', 'title': 'STERIS DECLARES $0.47 PER SHARE DIVIDEND', 'text': 'DUBLIN, IRELAND, FEB. 01, 2023 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- \xa0STERIS PLC (NYSE: STE) (“STERIS” OR THE “COMPANY”) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT THE COMPANY WILL DISTRIBUTE A QUARTERLY INTERIM DIVIDEND OF $0.47 PER SHARE. THE DIVIDEND IS PAYABLE MARCH 23, 2023 TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON FEBRUARY 24, 2023.'}